OL,4,BLast chance to vote for BBC Men's      
OL,5,BFootballer of the Year                 
OL,6,GVoting remains open for the BBC Men's  
OL,7,GFootballer of the Year 2026 award,     
OL,8,Gwhich will be presented at Sports      
OL,9,GPersonality of the Year.               
OL,11,FFans from the UK can vote from the     
OL,12,Ffive-player shortlist of Jude          
OL,13,FBellingham, Harry Kane, Kylian Mbappe, 
OL,14,FRodri and Lamine Yamal.                
OL,16,FThe vote closes on Friday, 27 November 
OL,17,Fat 09:00 GMT.                          
